, I was pretty milquetoast and libertarian but now I'm a hardline conservative through and through.\n\nThat shocked me, because when I think about what I believe in, I'd say *of course I'm a conservative!* As if suggesting I'm something else is offensive. But then I realized he's right. I never *used to* consider myself \"a conservative\". I didn't join the Republican club in high school. I didn't want to \"choose sides,\" because I still believed in the simplistic two-party system. I didn't know we had a deep communist infestation like we do.\n\nI want to credit Patriots.win as well as Elon Musk's \ud835\udd4f for that. For enlightening me. I know I'm not the only one.\n\nThank you.\n\nTRPA\n\ud83d\udc38", "author": "TheRedPilledArtist", "created": 1791917163729, "profile_picture": "gLOjTx59Rfh7", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "memechallenger33", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "I just want to thank PDW...", "last_comment_created": 1791946876572, "content": "<p>Someone who I'm really close with, who's known me for a long time, was really frank the other day. He said, <em>&quot;man, it's been really fun watching your character arc over the years.&quot;</em></p>\n<p>I said, <em>&quot;what?&quot;</em></p>\n<p>He told me that only several years ago, when I was new here, I was pretty milquetoast and libertarian but now I'm a hardline conservative through and through.</p>\n<p>That shocked me, because when I think about what I believe in, I'd say <em>of course I'm a conservative!</em> As if suggesting I'm something else is offensive. But then I realized he's right. I never <em>used to</em> consider myself &quot;a conservative&quot;. I didn't join the Republican club in high school. I didn't want to &quot;choose sides,&quot; because I still believed in the simplistic two-party system. I didn't know we had a deep communist infestation like we do.</p>\n<p>I want to credit Patriots.win as well as Elon Musk's \ud835\udd4f for that. For enlightening me. I know I'm not the only one.</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n<p>TRPA\n\ud83d\udc38</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 25, "score_up": 151, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2107438952391061902", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVewOPZr", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 72, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8884773, "raw_content": "", "author": "_Liberty_Prime_", "created": 1791931587755, "profile_picture": "evWxa80vv4JN", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "_Liberty_Prime_", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVewOPZr.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/MAGA__Patriot/status/2107438952391061902?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "She doesn't like a lot of White People ", "last_comment_created": 1791941071907, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 72, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 524, "created": 1791287575000, "id": "2107438952391061902", "vid